Defense\n\nGrow 16 unique plants to defend your base while surviving constant zombie attacks.\n{27013479338336122}\n\n\ud83e\udeb4 Your Defense Becomes Your Weapon\n\nWhen chaos breaks out, rip plants directly from the ground and use them in combat. Your defense system becomes your arsenal.\n{2386969325145124}\n\n\ud83d\udd2b First-Person VR Combat\n\nMove, shoot, and survive inside collapsing defenses as massive zombie waves push forward. Face 9+ zombie types, each with unique behaviors and attack patterns.\n{984168434405467}\n\n\ud83e\udddf Boss Battles & Progression\n\nFace massive bosses like the Toilet Zombie across 24 levels of escalating challenge.\n{27699748766277487}\n\n\ud83c\udf3f The invasion never stops growing.\n\nYour garden is under siege.\n\nSurvive it.\n", "short_description": "Shoot, plant, and survive\u2014defend against zombie waves with strategy and firepower."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://digi-eden.com/page/PrivacyPolicy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "DigiEden Studio", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.digi-eden.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "275629210202852"}, {"id": "644354873106712"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "27344174365237571"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491830904_191